===== Installation =====
  - → [[:downloads|Obtain firmware]]
  - → [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install OpenWrt]]
  - → [[:downloads|Latest OpenWrt release]]

==== Installing OpenWrt ====
  - Prepare TFTP server serving at static 192.168.11.10/24 address
  - Rename OpenWrt initramfs image to ''<model>-initramfs.uImage'' matching your model (''WXR-5950AX12-initramfs.uImage'' for example) and place it to TFTP directory
  - Power off the router and connect one of the 1GbE LAN ports directly to a TFPT server with an Ethernet cable
  - Press and hold the AOSS (WPS) button and power on the device until the front LED turns from pink to white
  - The device will download initramfs image from TFTP server and boot (this step does not perform any changes at the device ((Due to missing ath11k callibration data file the WiFi does not work in this mode))
  - Backup all device's mtd partitions via UI or command line and store them somewhere safe
  - Flash the OpenWRT sysupgrade image to your device via UI or command line (this will replace the OEM firmware with OpenWRT)

==== Revert to OEM firmware ====

  - Repeat steps 1. to 5. as above
  - Flash the OAM firmware
    - option: by [[commit>?p=openwrt/openwrt.git;a=commit;h=f490295bf213c5e181d16cbe53c163c1c9983e45|extracting and flashing the firmware]] from OAM image
    - option: by restoring the ''rootfs'', ''rootfs_recover'' and ''user_property'' partitions from backup using ''ubiformat'' CLI tool

