==== Opening the case ====

Remove 4 torx T9 screws and carefully pry open the plastic back-plate. Be careful not to cut or disconnect some of the 8 wifi anntena cables. Thread carefully, it is almost impossible not to break some of the clips (especially the sideway ones), but the plastic backplate is quite sturdy, it will fit back pretty tight even with some clips missing. 

